{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NrNjPVywAb1795656357.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>霧淞是安徽黃山冬季的天然奇景，千峰萬樹似被銀絲纏繞，晶瑩剔透。當景區氣溫跌至零度以下，加上霧氣濕度大，就會形成霧淞景觀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AH.SNOW.MTV.1110-1126_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cLmmFcgzHG1795656473.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.664813+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":60,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:46.867667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:17.603746+00:00","content_hash":"df0b55e34373c98e0b0a2ce3601332c77d07ba5eddec489fab861e6b270ca69f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}